{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000023","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000023"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000023","label":"和仲","status":"active","historicity":"legendary_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"和仲","mention_ids":["c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0105"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0105","chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p012","quote":"和仲"}],"identity_note":"僅依本篇上下文建立；不因同名自動跨篇合併。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"和仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000023","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p012","text":"乃命羲、和，敬順昊天，數法日月星辰，敬授民時。分命羲仲，居郁夷，曰暘谷。敬道日出，便程東作。日中，星鳥，以殷中春。其民析，鳥獸字微。申命羲叔，居南交。便程南爲，敬致。日永，星火，以正中夏。其民因，鳥獸希革。申命和仲，居西土，曰昧谷。敬道日入，便程西成。夜中，星虛，以正中秋。其民夷易，鳥獸毛毨。申命和叔，居北方，曰幽都。便在伏物。日短，星昴，以正中冬。其民燠，鳥獸氄毛。歲三百六十六日，以閏月正四時。信飭百官，衆功皆興。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"羲、和","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"可能為個人、官職、群體、氏族或國號；不憑本篇未明示的外部對應補造身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"羲仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000021","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"羲叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000022","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"和仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000023","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m012-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"和叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000024","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_